        <h1>Dip Belt and Weighted Hang Program: Equipment and 4-Week Plan</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">The equipment, setup and an example 4-week plan for weighted dead hangs. The weighted dead hang guide covers when to add weight and how fast.</p>
      </header>
